dsh-omp-tui
===========

Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-omp-tui contributors.

This project studied and adapted architectural patterns from
tomowang/dsh-tui (https://github.com/tomowang/dsh-tui), licensed under the MIT
License. Adapted areas are limited to the DeepSeek Harness bundle/startup
composition, session-ID normalization, event-log projection concepts, Agent
lifecycle sequencing, and the shared approval/question FIFO design. The UI was
rewritten for @earendil-works/pi-tui and contains no Ink or React runtime.

tomowang/dsh-tui copyright notices and its MIT license remain applicable to
the portions described above.
